   555	\section{Formalization support for the robustness bound}
   556	
   557	The following monotonicity statement is not a named result of the source
   558	article.  It records, as a single inequality, the adjustment of the universal
   559	constants of Theorem~\ref{thm:pauli} that is used when the robustness bound is
   560	passed from its squared to its unsquared form, and when several estimates are
